=head1 NAME

Tsuzuri::HTTP - a loopback-only preview and authoring server

=head1 SECURITY

This intentionally small HTTP implementation is for local preview only. It
only accepts loopback bind addresses and Host headers, limits request sizes,
rejects cross-origin writes and symbolic links in editable paths, and requires
a per-process editor token for the editor document as well as every API call.

